      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-45136",
      ":question/problem": "Richard wants to buy a pair of shoes. The store has a special promotion: if the customer posts a photo of the shoes on social media, the price for that customer will decrease for each \"like\" that the photo gets. The store charges $$33.25$ for one like, $$32.50$ for two likes, $$31.75$ for three likes, and so on. If this trend continues, how many likes did Richard get if he paid $$27.25$ for the shoes?\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
